Version: 1.99.0
Date: 2026-11-07
+ Supports MGnify API v2
+ Substantially faster: what took minutes takes seconds, and tens of thousands of analyses can be fetched in minutes
+ Focuses on abundance tables: fetchStudies and fetchAnalyses return taxonomic and functional profiles as TreeSummarizedExperiment or MultiAssayExperiment
+ Additional features of earlier versions, e.g., fetching files, are deprecated

Version: 1.9.1
Date: 2026-10-19
+ getResult returns NULL with a warning instead of failing when no data could be fetched

Version: 0.99.23
Date: 2024-03-04
+ getReturn fix: failed constructing MAE if samples in experiments did not match

Version: 0.99.20
Date: 2024-02-26
+ searchAnalysis returns now a named vector where names are accession IDs that was fed as input

Version: 0.99.19
Date: 2024-02-15
+ Fix deprecated mgnify_client function

Version: 0.99.18
Date: 2024-02-12
+ Last modifications for Biocondutor submission

Changes in version 0.99.17
+ Added getData function for fetching raw data from the database

Version 0.99.0
+ Support for TreeSummarizedExperiment and MultiAssayExperiment
+ Submitted to Bioconductor
